These files are from HakiOS, https://github.com/oosexgang/hackios-xnu-kernel at commit a3384e0, userland/src and userland/mkeagl.py.
Changes for the Galaxy S9: eagl.c is gated on the boot-arg sweeteagl=1 and logs to /dev/console; gl_osmesa.c does not use OES_EGL_image.
IOKit/IOKitLib.h is ours: the few declarations eagl.c needs, because the iOS SDK has no IOKit headers.

